兵会同讨郭马","evidence":["santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0083","role":"奉命统率相关军队","evidence":["santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415","source_order":[48,112,119],"order":8871}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0083","name":"陶璜","evidence":["santizhu-q-271fd58ce4bc07876cf3","santizhu-q-c88c3e9118bd688f1e90","santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415","santizhu-q-87d9b98109f974bb2a40","santizhu-q-a1b40436dd013fe2c56c","santizhu-q-1020cd18ac28f932ea8c"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-1020cd18ac28f932ea8c","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-d7f8233ea732bc33e866","layer":"pei","quote":"稷等日未满而粮尽，乞降于璜；璜不许，而给粮使守。吴人并谏，璜曰：‘霍弋已死，无能来者；可须其粮尽，然后乃受；使彼来无罪，而我取有义。内训吾民，外怀邻国，不亦可乎！’稷、炅粮尽，救不至，乃纳之","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2b1c35672a6ca8714ea","start":63,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-271fd58ce4bc07876cf3","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-0480c5aebff66afe1ffb","layer":"original","quote":"遣监军虞汜、威南将军薛珝、苍梧太守陶璜由荆州〖1〗；监军李勖、督军徐存从建安海道〖2〗：皆就合浦，击交阯","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-87d9b98109f974bb2a40","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-9a7cf4443f939e02dfaa","layer":"pei","quote":"陶璜等以炅壮勇，欲赦之。而则子允，固求杀炅；炅亦不为璜等屈。","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2b1c35672a6ca8714ea","start":97,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-886185f879ca92b29415","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-0dafd2801f25e863dc33","layer":"original","quote":"命交州牧陶璜部伍所领及合浦、郁林诸郡兵〖16〗，当与东西军共击马","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":475,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":119,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-a1b40436dd013fe2c56c","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-9a7cf4443f939e02dfaa","layer":"pei","quote":"璜等怒，面缚炅，诘之，曰：‘晋（兵）贼！’炅厉声曰：‘吴狗！何等为贼？’吴人生剖其腹，允割其心肝，骂曰：‘庸复作贼？’炅犹骂不止，曰：‘尚欲斩汝孙皓，汝父何死狗也！’乃斩之","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2b1c35672a6ca8714ea","start":127,"end":213,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-c88c3e9118bd688f1e90","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-8218bfa6bf0ccc90e22e","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，汜、璜破交阯，擒杀晋所置守将，九真、日南皆还属","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
